fonts-tiresias (0.1-6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian/control
    - Set new maintainer and uploaders (Closes: #914665)
    - Drop debhelper, set debhelper-compat (= 13)
    - Split Build-Depends to Build-Depends-Indep
    - Set Standards-Version: 4.5.0
    - Drop upstream Homepage:, it's dead
    - Add Vcs-*
    - Set Rules-Requires-Root: no
  * debian/install
    - Move to /usr/share/fonts/truetype/tiresias, "fonts-" is useless
  * debian/copyright
    - Convert to copyright format 1.0
  * Drop debian/compat
  * Add debian/salsa-ci.yml

